From 1442ccd514668fe525f723819f2de8ebd79c8ac2 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: hibreak <hibreak@localhost>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:51:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Launcher3: plain surfaces and solid outlines on e-ink

With debug.sysui.eink_palette=1 (the property SystemUI uses for its
two-tone palette):
- the scrims behind recents and the app list are plain paper (white, or
  black in dark mode) instead of a translucent grey. On the Bigme
  HiBreak Pro the recents screen was 70% mid-grey, which an e-ink panel
  shows as dithered noise;
- recents cards, the popup menu's items and the app list's search box
  get a 2dp outline in the text colour, because their fill is as white
  as what is behind them and their shadows are too faint to see.

Change-Id: I2b3c4d5e6f708192a3b4c5d6e7f8091a2b3c4d5e
